   "text": "140~141쪽 식 또는 방정식을 풀고 답이 맞으면 준비물 3의 붙임딱지를 붙인다.",
   "subItems": [
    {
     "label": "1행",
     "text": "$2(3x+11)=-2-12 \\to x=-6$, $\\frac{1}{4}\\times\\frac{8}{6}=\\frac{1}{3}$"
    },
    {
     "label": "2행",
     "text": "$3\\times(-6)\\div\\frac{1}{2}=-36$, $x-12=-2x-3 \\to x=3$"
    },
    {
     "label": "3행",
     "text": "$0.4x=1.2-0.2x \\to x=2$, $-3x+4=10 \\to x=-2$"
    },
    {
     "label": "4행",
     "text": "$\\frac{1}{4}\\times1.6=\\frac{2}{5}$, $\\frac{1}{2}\\div\\left(-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)=-3$"
    },
    {
     "label": "5행",
     "text": "$(+1.6)\\times(-5)\\div2=-4$, $\\frac{2x-4}{3}=\\frac{-3x+6}{4} \\to x=2$"
    },
    {
     "label": "6행",
     "text": "$(-2)\\times(-4)=8$, $5(4x-2)=-2x+1 \\to x=\\frac{1}{2}$"
    },
    {
     "label": "7행",
     "text": "$3=7-x \\to x=4$, $2^3\\times3\\div6=4$, $1.5\\times3\\times0.2=0.9$"
    },
    {
     "label": "8행",
     "text": "$4x+2=-10 \\to x=-3$, $3^2\\times(-8)\\div6=-12$"
    },
    {
     "label": "9행",
     "text": "$\\frac{16}{3}\\div\\frac{8}{6}=4$, $\\frac{3}{2}x-\\frac{5}{2}=1 \\to x=\\frac{7}{3}$"
    },
    {
     "label": "10행",
     "text": "$x-\\frac{1}{4}(x+2)=13 \\to x=18$, $\\frac{x}{4}+1=\\frac{x}{3}+2 \\to x=-12$"
    },
    {
     "label": "11행",
     "text": "$0.3x-0.6=0.2x+1.4 \\to x=20$, $\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{6}{5}=\\frac{9}{10}$"
    },
    {
     "label": "12행",
     "text": "$\\frac{3}{2}x-7=5 \\to x=8$, $\\frac{x}{5}-2=\\frac{x}{3}+4 \\to x=-45$"
    }
